#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:2
msgid "典型工作流示例"
msgstr "Typical workflow example"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:4
msgid "本页汇总 DaoAI 天眼系统内置的“模板工作流”示例。可在工作流编辑器中导入、查看并按需调整参数与区域配置。"
msgstr ""
"This page summarizes the \"template workflow\" examples built into the DaoAI"
" Video Analysis Platform.Parameters and zone configurations can be imported, viewed, "
"and adjusted as needed in the workflow editor."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:12
msgid "办公场景"
msgstr "Office scene"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:15
msgid "人员离岗检测"
msgstr "Personnel off-duty detection"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:17
msgid "用途：识别人员是否离开指定办公区域（离岗/值班空缺）。需在编辑器中配置“监控区域”坐标。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: Identify whether a person leaves the designated office area (off "
"duty/duty vacancy).The \"monitoring area\" coordinates need to be configured"
" in the editor."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:18
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:45
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:65
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:84
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:109
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:131
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:153
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:179
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:198
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:218
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:238
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:261
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:299
msgid "组成与流程："
msgstr "Composition and process:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:19
msgid "通用检测模型：标签输入 ``person`` 检测场景中的人员；"
msgstr ""
"General detection model: label input ``person`` detects people in the scene;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:20
msgid "检测过滤: 过滤出置信度低于0.5的检测结果；"
msgstr ""
"Detection filtering: Filter out detection results with a confidence level "
"lower than 0.5;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:21
msgid "高速追踪：为检测到的对象分配并维护稳定的轨迹/ID，便于持续分析；"
msgstr ""
"High-speed tracking: Assign and maintain stable trajectories/IDs for "
"detected objects to facilitate continuous analysis;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:22
msgid "区域内存在时间：统计在区域内或者外停留时长；"
msgstr ""
"Existence time in the area: counts the time spent in or outside the area;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:23
msgid "属性定义: 提取区域内存在时间节点的 离开区域的时间值 ``time_out_of_zone``；"
msgstr ""
"Attribute definition: Extract the time value ``time_out_of_zone`` of the "
"time node that exists in the zone leaving the zone;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:24
msgid "条件继续：当停留时长 ``>= 15`` 秒时，进入后续步骤（可视化/事件保存）；"
msgstr ""
"Conditional continuation: When the dwell time is ``>= 15`` seconds, enter "
"the subsequent steps (visualization/event saving);"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:25
msgid "可视化与事件保存:"
msgstr "Visualization and event storage:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:27
msgid "在图像上绘制“监控区域”多边形与半透明遮罩；"
msgstr ""
"Draw \"surveillance area\" polygons and semi-transparent masks on the image;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:28
msgid "在仪表盘中展示带标注的图像；"
msgstr "Display annotated images in dashboards;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:29
msgid "保存事件与视频片段。"
msgstr "Save events and video clips."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst
msgid "查看工作流 JSON"
msgstr "View workflow JSON"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:42
msgid "人员聚集检测"
msgstr "People gathering detection"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:44
msgid "用途：识别指定区域内的人员聚集/拥挤情况。"
msgstr "Purpose: Identify gathering/crowding of people in designated areas."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:46
msgid "人员检测：标签输入 ``person`` 检测画面中的人员；"
msgstr "Person detection: Tag input ``person`` detects people in the screen;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:47
msgid "区域过滤：在设定区域内筛选检测结果；"
msgstr "Area filtering: Filter test results within a set area;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:48
msgid "条件继续：当区域内人数 ``>= 4`` 时，进入后续步骤；"
msgstr ""
"Condition continues: When the number of people in the area ``>= 4``, enter "
"the subsequent steps;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:49
msgid "可视化与事件保存：叠加框与标签并保存事件。"
msgstr ""
"Visualization and event saving: Overlay boxes and labels and save events."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:62
msgid "异常行为检测"
msgstr "Abnormal behavior detection"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:64
msgid "用途：识别抽烟、打电话、玩手机、摔倒、睡岗、翻越围栏等异常/不当行为（需自训练对应模型）。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: Identify abnormal/inappropriate behaviors such as smoking, talking "
"on the phone, playing with mobile phones, falling, sleeping on the post, "
"climbing over fences, etc. (requires self-training of corresponding models)."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:66
msgid "行为检测模型：输出异常行为类别与位置；"
msgstr ""
"Behavior detection model: output abnormal behavior categories and locations;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:67
msgid "类别过滤：仅保留目标异常类别；"
msgstr "Category filtering: only retain target anomaly categories;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:68
msgid "条件继续：当检测数量 ``>= 1`` 时，进入后续步骤；"
msgstr ""
"Condition continues: When the detection quantity ``>= 1``, ​​enter the "
"subsequent steps;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:69
msgid "可视化与事件保存：绘制框与标签、保存事件并在仪表盘展示。"
msgstr ""
"Visualization and event saving: draw boxes and labels, save events and "
"display them on the dashboard."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:81
msgid "长时停留检测"
msgstr "Long stay detection"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:83
msgid "用途：统计目标在指定区域内的停留时长，识别过长停留（如长时间玩手机）。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: Count how long a target stays in a designated area, and identify "
"excessive stays (such as playing with mobile phones for a long time)."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:85
msgid "通用检测模型：检测场景中的目标对象；"
msgstr "Universal detection model: detect target objects in the scene;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:86
msgid "检测过滤：按需要在设定区域或类别上筛选用于跟踪的检测结果；"
msgstr ""
"Detection filtering: Filter detection results for tracking in set areas or "
"categories as needed;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:87
msgid "目标跟踪：为检测到的对象分配并维护稳定的轨迹/ID；"
msgstr ""
"Object tracking: Assign and maintain stable trajectories/IDs for detected "
"objects;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:88
msgid "区域内存在时间：统计在区内停留时长；"
msgstr "Existence time in the area: counts the length of stay in the area;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:89
msgid "属性定义: 提取区域内存在时间节点的 离开区域的时间值 ``time_in_zone``；"
msgstr ""
"Attribute definition: Extract the time value ``time_in_zone`` of the time "
"node that exists in the zone leaving the zone;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:90
msgid "条件继续：当停留时间达到阈值（示例为 ``>= 1``，实际可在编辑器设定秒数）时，进入后续步骤（可视化/事件保存）；"
msgstr ""
"Conditional continuation: When the residence time reaches the threshold "
"(example is ``>= 1``, ​​the number of seconds can actually be set in the "
"editor), enter the subsequent steps (visualization/event saving);"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:91
msgid "可视化与事件保存：叠加框与“Time In Zone”标签，保存事件与视频片段；"
msgstr ""
"Visualization and event storage: overlay box and \"Time In Zone\" label to "
"save events and video clips;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:103
msgid "Highway 场景"
msgstr "Highway scene"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:106
msgid "交通拥堵检测"
msgstr "Traffic jam detection"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:108
msgid "用途：结合车辆检测、跟踪与速度估计，识别道路拥堵程度（轻度/中度/重度），并输出事件类型与摘要。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: Combine vehicle detection, tracking and speed estimation to "
"identify road congestion levels (mild/moderate/severe), and output event "
"types and summaries."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:110
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:154
msgid "目标检测：检测车、卡车、摩托等对象；"
msgstr ""
"Target detection: detecting objects such as cars, trucks, motorcycles;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:111
msgid "目标跟踪：为车辆分配并维护稳定轨迹/ID；"
msgstr ""
"Target tracking: assign and maintain stable trajectories/IDs for vehicles;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:112
msgid "速度估计：依据标定多边形、方向点与边缘距离计算车速（km/h）；"
msgstr ""
"Speed ​​estimation: Calculate the vehicle speed (km/h) based on the "
"calibration polygon, direction point and edge distance;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:113
msgid "在区时长：统计车辆在指定区域的停留时间；"
msgstr "Time in zone: counts the time a vehicle stays in a designated area;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:114
msgid "拥堵综合分析：融合检测、轨迹、速度与停留信息，计算占用率与拥堵等级，并输出事件类型；"
msgstr ""
"Comprehensive congestion analysis: fuse detection, trajectory, speed and "
"stay information, calculate occupancy and congestion levels, and output "
"event types;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:115
msgid "逻辑判断：当拥堵条件为真时继续进入可视化与事件保存；"
msgstr ""
"Logical judgment: when the congestion condition is true, continue to enter "
"visualization and event saving;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:116
msgid "可视化与事件保存：叠加事件标签、保存图像与视频片段，并可在仪表盘展示。"
msgstr ""
"Visualization and event storage: Overlay event labels, save images and video"
" clips, and display them on the dashboard."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:128
msgid "昼夜模型切换"
msgstr "Day and night model switching"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:130
msgid "用途：根据时间自动切换白天/夜间检测模型，适应光照变化，保证识别稳定性（需配置模型 UID）。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: Automatically switch day/night detection models according to time, "
"adapt to lighting changes, and ensure recognition stability (model UID needs"
" to be configured)."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:132
msgid "自定义 Python 模块：根据当前时间输出应使用的模型 UID，；"
msgstr ""
"Custom Python module: output the model UID that should be used based on the "
"current time;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:133
msgid "通用检测：按动态 UID 选择并运行检测模型；"
msgstr "Universal detection: select and run detection models by dynamic UID;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:134
msgid "目标跟踪、速度估计、在区时长：与拥堵检测一致，分别统计轨迹、速度与在区停留；"
msgstr ""
"Target tracking, speed estimation, and time in the zone: consistent with "
"congestion detection, counting trajectory, speed, and stay in the zone "
"respectively;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:135
msgid "违法/拥堵判定：输出是否违规/拥堵及事件类型；"
msgstr ""
"Illegal/congestion determination: output whether it is illegal/congested and"
" the event type;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:136
msgid "逻辑判断：当触发条件成立时进入可视化与事件保存；"
msgstr ""
"Logical judgment: when the trigger condition is established, enter "
"visualization and event saving;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:137
msgid "可视化与事件保存：绘制事件信息并保存图像/视频，支持仪表盘展示。"
msgstr ""
"Visualization and event saving: Draw event information and save "
"images/videos, supporting dashboard display."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:150
msgid "车速与行驶轨迹检测"
msgstr "Vehicle speed and driving trajectory detection"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:152
msgid "用途：实时检测车辆速度并分析行驶轨迹，用于识别超速、异常减速、逆行、频繁变道等行为，辅助交通安全监管。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: Real-time detection of vehicle speed and analysis of driving "
"trajectories, used to identify behaviors such as speeding, abnormal "
"deceleration, retrograde driving, frequent lane changes, etc., and assist in"
" traffic safety supervision."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:155
msgid "目标跟踪：维护稳定的车辆轨迹/ID；"
msgstr "Target tracking: maintain stable vehicle trajectory/ID;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:156
msgid "速度估计：通过标定与方向点计算车速；"
msgstr ""
"Speed ​​estimation: Calculate vehicle speed through calibration and "
"direction points;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:157
msgid "在区时长：统计在指定车道或区域的停留时间；"
msgstr "Time in zone: counts the time spent in a designated lane or area;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:158
msgid "违规/轨迹分析：综合速度、轨迹与停留信息识别超速、逆行、异常变道等；"
msgstr ""
"Violation/trajectory analysis: comprehensive speed, trajectory and stop "
"information to identify speeding, retrograde driving, abnormal lane changes,"
" etc.;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:159
msgid "逻辑判断：当违规条件为真时进入可视化与事件保存；"
msgstr ""
"Logical judgment: when the violation condition is true, enter visualization "
"and event saving;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:160
msgid "可视化与事件保存：叠加事件标签，保存图像/视频，并可在仪表盘展示。"
msgstr ""
"Visualization and event saving: overlay event labels, save images/videos, "
"and display them on the dashboard."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:173
msgid "Construction Site 场景"
msgstr "Construction Site scene"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:176
msgid "工地热人数统计"
msgstr "Construction site hot people statistics"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:178
msgid "用途：统计画面中人员数量，便于了解现场人员密度与热度。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: Count the number of people in the screen to facilitate "
"understanding of the density and popularity of people on site."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:180
#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:262
msgid "目标检测：检测人员；"
msgstr "Target detection: detection personnel;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:181
msgid "检测过滤：仅保留人员且置信度 >= 0.5；"
msgstr "Detection filtering: only keep people with confidence level >= 0.5;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:182
msgid "属性提取：计算检测数量用于事件类型或展示；"
msgstr ""
"Attribute extraction: Calculate the number of detections for event type or "
"display;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:183
msgid "可视化与事件保存：叠加框与标签，按人数保存事件与视频片段。"
msgstr ""
"Visualization and event storage: overlay boxes and labels, save events and "
"video clips by number of people."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:195
msgid "区域占用检测"
msgstr "Area occupancy detection"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:197
msgid "用途：检测指定区域是否被物体占用（车、卡车、摩托、大件物品等），需在编辑器配置区域坐标。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: To detect whether the specified area is occupied by objects (cars, "
"trucks, motorcycles, large items, etc.), the area coordinates need to be "
"configured in the editor."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:199
msgid "目标检测：检测目标类别；"
msgstr "Target detection: detect target category;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:200
msgid "区域过滤：在目标区域筛选检测结果；"
msgstr "Area filtering: Filter detection results in the target area;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:201
msgid "目标跟踪：维护稳定轨迹与 ID；"
msgstr "Target tracking: maintain stable trajectory and ID;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:202
msgid "条件继续：当区域内存在目标（数量 >= 1）进入可视化与事件保存；"
msgstr ""
"Conditional continuation: When there are targets in the area (number >= 1), "
"enter visualization and event saving;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:203
msgid "可视化与事件保存：绘制框与标签并保存事件。"
msgstr ""
"Visualization and event saving: draw boxes and labels and save events."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:215
msgid "作业区人员距离检测"
msgstr "Personnel distance detection in working area"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:217
msgid "用途：检测危险/作业区域是否有人员靠近，辅助安全管控；需在编辑器配置区域坐标。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: Detect whether there are people approaching dangerous/working areas"
" to assist safety control; the area coordinates need to be configured in the"
" editor."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:219
msgid "目标检测：检测人员（staff）；"
msgstr "Target detection: detection staff (staff);"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:220
msgid "区域过滤：在危险区域筛选检测结果；"
msgstr "Area filtering: Filter test results in dangerous areas;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:221
msgid "条件继续：当区域内存在人员（数量 >= 1）进入可视化；"
msgstr ""
"Condition continues: when there are people in the area (number >= 1) enter "
"the visualization;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:222
msgid "可视化与事件保存：绘制框与标签并保存事件与视频。"
msgstr ""
"Visualization and event saving: draw boxes and labels and save events and "
"videos."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:235
msgid "灭火器存在检测"
msgstr "Fire extinguisher presence detection"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:237
msgid "用途：检测特定区域是否存在灭火器；可用于发现灭火器缺失或被挪走。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: Detect whether there is a fire extinguisher in a specific area; can"
" be used to find that the fire extinguisher is missing or has been moved."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:239
msgid "目标检测：检测灭火器；"
msgstr "Target detection: detecting fire extinguishers;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:240
msgid "目标跟踪与可视化：绘制框与标签；"
msgstr "Target tracking and visualization: drawing boxes and labels;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:241
msgid "越界/在区时长：统计灭火器离开区域的时间并聚合；"
msgstr ""
"Cross-border/in-zone time: count the time the fire extinguisher leaves the "
"zone and aggregate it;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:242
msgid "条件继续：当离区时长达到阈值（示例 3s）进入事件保存；"
msgstr ""
"Conditional continuation: When the out-of-zone duration reaches the "
"threshold (example 3s), enter the event save;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:243
msgid "事件保存与仪表盘：保存图片/视频并在仪表盘展示。"
msgstr ""
"Event saving and dashboard: Save pictures/videos and display them on the "
"dashboard."

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:255
msgid "通用"
msgstr "Universal"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:258
msgid "发送HTTP消息"
msgstr "Send HTTP message"

#: ../../source/user_guide/template_workflows.rst:260
msgid "用途：当检测到目标（示例：人员）时，触发自定义 Python 生成消息并通过 Webhook 推送到外部系统。"
msgstr ""
"Purpose: When a target (example: person) is detected, trigger a custom "
"Python message to be generated and pushed to an external system via a "
"webhook."

